  "details": "It might be nice for there to be an Udon API that you could call to get a localized string for common UI labels, things like\n\n- \"local settings\"\n\n- \"synced settings\"\n\n- \"performance\"\n\n- \"show\" / \"hide\"\n\n- \"mirror\"\n\n- \"low quality\" / \"high quality\"\n\nIdeally it would be something that the community could contribute suggestions to, both for new terms to localize, and for localizations into new languages.",
